    "description": "**Always 100% free for everyone.** No early-bird tiers, no 'later-on' fees. We\u2019re sitting on the grass which may be wet, **so get your picnic blanket, mat, chair or something to sit on.** Feel free to bring your own food, or drinks if you like.\nWe\u2019ll be chilling under a big tree adjacent to the Lady Falcon Coffee truck in **Alamo Square** with a view of the **Painted Ladies**, as shown in the cover photo above. I\u2019ll share our **live location** and **what I\u2019m wearing** in the comments below, so you can easily find us.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\nNo business affiliations. Just good vibes, great company, and memorable moments.",
