    "description": "Join us for a lively evening with engaging conversations, **line dancing**, pool table, shuffleboard, delicious food, and a chance to connect with **like-minded** people.\n\nThis is a 21+ event (**ID required**). Once you\u2019re inside the venue, grab a drink/food and **gather at the tables by the pool-table** **at 7:45p.m.** **Please be on time;** once the **line dancing starts at 8:00 p.m**., it's hard to identify who in the dancers are from the meetup group. I\u2019ll share what I\u2019m wearing in the comments so you can easily find me.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\nNo business affiliations. Just good vibes, great company, and memorable moments.",
