    "category": "workshop",
    "type": "workshop",
    "tags": [
      "San Francisco",
      "Meetup",
      "Workshop"
    ],
    "description": "**RSVP via:**\nhttps://app.gistirl.com/event-details/i7NmnIslofB97tNUCYJb\n**Early Bird Discounts \\| More $ Later**\n\n^^DOWNLOAD THE APP TO GET A TICKET & ATTEND THE EVENT\n\nLet the artist within you meet other artists in the city!!\n**(WE ONLY HAVE 70 SEATS AVAILABLE!!!)**\n\nSpend an hour in genuine one-on-one conversations with local creatives you have never met. There is no awkward mingling or wondering who to approach next. Instead of talking about your creative projects but never actually making the time to sit down and do the work, we will do speed-friending and then start a co-working session together. Same morning. No follow-up texts. No scheduling headaches.\n\nAgenda\n\n10:00AM - Check-In\nFollow the link to complete a quick profile setup on your phone.\n\n\\*Meet at Golden Gate Park near the Big Rec Field off MLK Dr. I'll have my location on and I'll be wearing a red jacket so yall can notice me!\n\n10:15AM - 11:00AM - One-on-One Rounds\nOur app pairs you for focused conversations. Find out who shares your creative medium, current project hurdles, and artistic vision!\n\nEvery 6-8 minutes, you will rotate to meet someone new! It's like speed friending!\n\n11:00AM+ - Form Groups & head inside the cafe to grab coffee and find a spot to work together. We'll grab coffee and find a spot to work together.\n\nDon't just collect contacts. Actually grab coffee and work with new people and see if this becomes your regular crew for new cafes and creative spaces to explore for future co-working sessions.\n\nWant to stay in touch with someone? Use the app - it lets you connect without ever sharing your phone number.\n\n**RSVP via:**\nhttps://app.gistirl.com/event-details/i7NmnIslofB97tNUCYJb\n**Early Bird Discounts \\| More $ Later**",
