    "description": "A chance to check out an Adult Ball Pool @ Ballie Ballerson where we will have a VIP Area for up to 20 people, and free welcome cocktails/mocktails (or glass of prosecco, beer, non alcoholic beer, mocktail)\n\nThey will allow us to have access to VIP area for the night where we can have 2 hour access to Ball Pool and can head to the dancefloor later.\n\n**What you need to know:**\n-Must Bring ID (Driving License, Passport etc.) - we have had people refused entry in past so please bring\n\\- Smart Casual attire for the night\n\\- You must wear secure\\, flat shoes in the ball pits\n\\- Trainers are a\\-okay\\, just please avoid wearing head to toe casual sportswear and tracksuits\n\\- Clean Balls\\! \\- Specialist ball cleaner gets the run around\\, it gobbles up around 18\\,000 balls per hour and gives each ball a good wash and sanitise before popping them out to be dried\n\nIs it just one big ball pit? No. Plenty of room to move around and dancefloor she picture here:\nhttps://shoreditch.ballieballerson.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/08/venue-map-2.pdf\n\n**Schedule**\n6:45pm - 7:15pm - Meet Inside Venue VIP Area (Will let you know where we will be)\n7:15pm - 9:00pm - Enjoy the 2 Adult Ball Pools\n9:00pm + Drinks / VIP Area/ Feel free to stick around\n\nI will let you know on the day where we will be and what to say on entry as booking will be under my name\n\n**Tickets**\nTotal Cost of the Meetup including free cocktail/drink, is \u00a315 Only! and limited to 20 Spots in total, if you can make the payment here:\n\nhttps://paypal.me/MeetupSaltyYoga\n\nAny other questions let us know, look forward to seeing you then as this is one of the most fun meetups\n\nChris",
