    "description": "We are delighted to announce that our upcoming meetup is scheduled for **Tuesday, June 2th**. We invite you to join us at the Capital One Flat Iron office to discuss the latest advancements in Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence. There will also be an opportunity to network and enjoy some pizza.\n\nAgenda:\n5:30PM Doors open\n5:30PM - 6:15PM Reception, networking\n6:15PM - 7:15PM **Shafik Quoraishee, Senior Android/ML Games Engineer:** \"Understanding and Advancing General Intelligence Through Games\"\n7:15PM - 8:30PM Further Networking & get-together in the nearby bar.\n8:00PM - Afterparty/drinks @ Whiskey Roxx Bar, 239 Park Ave S\n!!! IMPORTANT !!!\n\\- Please provide your full legal name at the time of RSVP\\, as it is necessary to enter the building and please ensure to bring a valid photo ID\\.\n\nThis event is hosted at the Capital One Office! Enter through 11 W 19th Street main entrance. Show your photo ID at the front desk and proceed to the 3rd floor.",
