    "description": "Join us for a deep dive introduction to Amazon Quick Suite. [Amazon Quick](https://aws.amazon.com/quicksuite/) is an AI assistant for work that turns **questions into answers** and **answers into actions** \u2014 delivering measurable results, not just productivity tricks. Quick connects to everything and gives you grounded answers, then goes further by acting on your behalf.\n\nIn this session, we'll walk through the full Amazon Quick platform and show you how it brings AI-powered intelligence, collaboration, and automation together in one place:\nQuestions Into Answers\n\n* **Custom AI Agents** \u2014 AI agents that answer questions, take action, and get smarter with every interaction. One person builds it, everyone benefits. Tailored to specific roles, domains, or workflows, grounded in your data \u2014 not generic training sets \u2014 and shareable across your team or organization.\n* **Spaces** \u2014 Your team's shared knowledge in one place. Spaces bring files, dashboards, and data sources into one collaborative workspace with built-in access controls. One person's insight becomes the whole team's advantage.\n* **Quick Research** \u2014 Deep research in minutes, not days. Synthesizes internal docs, databases, and real-time web sources into professional, exportable reports ready to share \u2014 grounded in your business context, not generic results.\n* **Quick Sight** \u2014 Turn scattered data into strategic insights. AI-powered BI that unifies your enterprise data so anyone can explore, decide, and act \u2014 all inside Quick. Ask questions in plain language, get insights instantly. No separate BI tool, no extra licenses, no context-switching.\n\nHigh level schedule:\n4:30 - 4:45: Arrivals\n4:45 - 6:00: Presentation\n6:00 - 6:30: Networking\n\n**Bio**:\nUdaya is a Senior Solutions Architect at AWS and an AI-DLC Champion, with 18+ years of experience designing and building enterprise applications. He provides strategic guidance to ISV, Enterprise, SMB, and Retail customers on becoming AI-First organizations, focusing on three pillars: **(1) AI-DLC** \u2014 accelerating how you *build* software using the AI-Driven Development Lifecycle, delivering exponential velocity and quality across the entire development pipeline; **(2) Agentic Products** \u2014 embedding agentic AI capabilities into the products you *ship* to customers; and **(3) AI-Powered Workforce** \u2014 transforming how your people *work* internally with AI-augmented operations and productivity. Udaya works closely with customers to bring these pillars together \u2014 helping organizations move from incremental AI adoption to a true AI-First transformation on AWS.\n\n**Important instructions**\n\n* Event starts at 4:45 pm EST, but please allow at least 15 minutes for security to process registration\n* Please ensure that your meetup profile has your **full name.** Both first and last name are required and we will not be able to register attendees with just abbreviations or incomplete names.\n* There is an optional networking and Q&A event at the end of the meetup",
