    "description": "\ud83c\udf09 On **June 20th**, we\u2019re heading across two of NYC\u2019s most iconic bridges for a golden hour city walk through Brooklyn and Manhattan. Join us as we catch skyline views, waterfront sunsets, and some of the best photo spots in the city while walking from Brooklyn into Manhattan and back again.\n\n\ud83d\udccdMeetup: Brooklyn Bridge Park - Main Street at 6 PM. We\u2019ll gather for 30 minutes before starting the walk.\n\nAlong the way, we\u2019ll pass through some of NYC\u2019s most scenic spots:\n\n\u2022 Brooklyn Bridge Park - waterfront views of Lower Manhattan before we begin.\n\n\u2022 Brooklyn Bridge - walk across one of NYC\u2019s most famous bridges during golden hour, with skyline and river views the entire way.\n\n\u2022 Manhattan Bridge - cross back into Brooklyn with evening views of downtown Manhattan and the East River.\n\n\u2022 DUMBO - finish in one of Brooklyn\u2019s most iconic neighborhoods,\n\nWalk: \\~2 hours at a relaxed pace\n\n\ud83c\udf06 Tips for Enjoying the Walk:\n\u2022 Wear comfortable shoes\n\u2022 Bring water\n\nIt's free to join! Everyone 18+ is welcome \ud83c\udf89\n\n\ud83d\udcf8 Stay connected: Follow along on Instagram for more walks and event highlights: https://www.instagram.com/nycfoodies.club",
