    "description": "**\ud83d\udea8 IMPORTANT \ud83d\udea8**\n**Registration on luma is Mandatory**\n**Luma registration link:** https://luma.com/yypbjza0\n\n**Agenda**\n\n* **Shipping vertical features: one folder, many repos, LLM agents - Faster delivery without cross-team handoffs** by [Arghyadeep Majumder](https://www.linkedin.com/in/argodeep/), Senior Software Engineer - Empuls (Xoxoday)\n* **Building a Vectorless RAG system** by [Pratik Yadav](https://www.linkedin.com/in/pratikyadavdeveloper), Software Engineer, Emmes India\n* **How AI Helps Us in Enterprise React Development** by [Yogesh Kulsange](https://www.linkedin.com/in/yogesh-kulsange/), Senior Software Developer, Xoxoday\n* **Tracking opportunuties with Agents & AI Engineering** by [Mohammed Ayaan](https://www.linkedin.com/in/md-ayaan), Full Stack Engineer, Cognizant\n* **Ship Code Without Shipping a Build: Building a Self-Hosted OTA System for React Native** by [Srinivasa Sainath Samala](https://www.linkedin.com/in/smlsainath), VP - Engineering, Xoxoday\n* **Property-based testing for UIs** by [Priyanshu Jain](https://www.linkedin.com/in/ipriyanshujain/), Principal Engineer, OkCredit\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Venue Sponsor: [Xoxoday](https://www.xoxoday.com/)**\n\n**Follow us on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/ReactBangalore), [Linkedin](https://www.linkedin.com/company/react-bangalore), and [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/reactify_in) for more updates.**",
