    "description": "\ud83d\ude80 ProductTank Bengaluru x Smarsh\n\nCelebrating World Product Day 2026 with a deep dive into:\n\ud83d\udd25 **PMF Playbooks for AI & SaaS**\n\nAs AI reshapes how products are built, distributed, and adopted, finding true Product-Market Fit looks very different from the traditional SaaS journey. Join us for a morning of practical insights, real stories, and actionable frameworks from leaders building in this space today.\n\ud83d\udcc5 **May 30th**\n\u23f0 **10:00 AM \u2013 1:00 PM**\n\ud83d\udccd **Smarsh, Bengaluru**\n\n**Agenda:**\n\u2022 10:30 AM \u2013 11:15 AM \u2014 Keynote by Smarsh Leadership\n\u2022 11:15 AM \u2013 12:00 PM \u2014 Product Discovery in the AI Era : Finding PMF without losing clarity\n\u2022 12:00 PM \u2013 12:45 PM \u2014 PMF Playbook for AI-Native Products\n\u2022 12:45 PM onwards \u2014 Lunch & Networking\n\nExpect conversations around:\n\u2022 Building AI-native products\n\u2022 PMF challenges unique to AI & SaaS\n\u2022 Adoption, retention & trust in AI products\n\u2022 Lessons from scaling enterprise platforms",
