    "description": "Building a startup? Or already running one? Come join us at Startup Founders Meetup \u2013 a chill and meaningful gathering for Startup Founders, Co-Founders, Entrepreneurs, Business Owners and MSMEs\n\n\u200bThis meetup is all about real talk, real connections, and real support. We\u2019re bringing together a community of driven and passionate founders to share stories, exchange ideas and learn from each other\u2019s journeys.\n\nWhether you\u2019re just starting out, figuring things out, or already in the game \u2013 this space is for you.\n\u200bIt\u2019s a great chance to talk about your startup or business, get feedback, connect with other founders, and maybe even meet future collaborators or partners.\n\nNo boring speeches \u2013 just open conversations, useful insights, and people who get what you\u2019re building.\n\u200b\nIf you're looking to grow your network, gain clarity, or simply be around like-minded people chasing big goals \u2013 this is the place to be.\n\nCome as you are, bring your story and let\u2019s build something amazing together.\n\u200b\u200b\u200b\nIf you have any queries regarding the event, please feel free to reach out to us - 8971515241 / 6362850039",
