    "category": "workshop",
    "type": "workshop",
    "tags": [
      "Bangalore",
      "Meetup",
      "Workshop"
    ],
    "description": "The Software Development Life Cycle is being rewritten \u2014 by AI agents.\n\nFrom requirements gathering to deployment, AI agents are now capable of participating in every phase of the SDLC. But how does this actually work in practice? What changes, what stays the same, and where do humans still add the most value?\n\nIn this session, you'll learn:\n\\- How AI agents fit into each phase of the SDLC \\(requirements\\, design\\, dev\\, test\\, deploy\\)\n\\- Practical examples of agentic workflows in real projects\n\\- The new role of developers\\, testers\\, and PMs in an agentic SDLC\n\\- Common pitfalls and how to avoid them\n\nIdeal for developers, QA engineers, PMs, and tech leads who want to understand what's coming \u2014 and how to stay ahead.\n\n\ud83c\udfa4 Led by a Microsoft Certified Trainer.",
