    "description": "[Having trouble? Click here to RSVP](https://events.letsloop.app/b5bbfd58)\n\nOn Sundays we play. Battersea Park, 2pm sharp, on the grass by Pear Tree Cafe \u2014 look for the net up on the open athletic fields just north of the lake. We bring the net and the ball. You bring trainers and water. About two hours of casual pickup volleyball \u2014 rotate on, rotate off, no league points, no one keeps real score. All levels. If you have never played, this is the perfect time to try it.\n\nNo name tags. No 'let's go around and introduce ourselves.' No agenda. Just a game on a Sunday afternoon, with people who live nearby or are curious about the park.\n\nWe play in light rain. Heavy rain, we head to Pear Tree Cafe and stay for a drink. Solo welcome. +1 welcome. Couples welcome. About two hours on grass.",
