    "title": "Job Search in Switzerland: What Works in Today\u2019s Swiss Job Market",
    "subtitle": "Curated from Meetup \u00b7 Berlin",
    "category": "workshop",
    "type": "workshop",
    "tags": [
      "Berlin",
      "Meetup",
      "Workshop"
    ],
    "description": "You feel stuck navigating the Swiss labour market and are unsure how to make real progress?\nAfter more than ten years working within the Swiss job landscape as a job coach, lecturer and portfolio careerist, I bring a clear, experience-based perspective on what actually works in applications, networking and identifying opportunities beyond formal job postings.\nThe Swiss labour market operates on more than CVs and cover letters. Timing, referrals and relationships play a decisive role.\nThis session helps you understand these dynamics and translate them into concrete action.\n\n### **What you will gain**\n\n* Clear insights into how the Swiss job market functions in practice\n* Concrete strategies to improve your applications and visibility\n* A structured approach to networking in a Swiss context\n* Space to ask questions and learn from shared experiences\n\n### **Who this is for**\n\n* International professionals targeting the Swiss market\n* Individuals not receiving interview invitations despite strong profiles\n* Professionals seeking a more strategic, less reactive job search approach\n\n### **Further learning**\n\nThis session is part of a broader series including deep dives into CV strategy, motivation letters, networking and overall application positioning.\n\nFor more Info check: https://portfoliocareerinstitute.com/product/jobsearch-navigating-the-swiss-labour-market/",
