    "description": "ONLY OPEN TO SINGLES IN THE DMV\nHello Singles,\n\nThis is not a physical or virtual event. It\u2019s a call out to men and women to join our candidate pool for matchmaking!\n\nIf you\u2019re dating in the DMV, you already know\u2026 it can start to feel like a full-time job. The apps, the guessing, the constant starting over.\n\nThis is where we do things differently.\n\nThe Maryland Singles Social Club is always welcoming new candidates into our matchmaking network for men and women ages 25\u201375. It\u2019s completely free to join, and it gives you access to real, vetted introductions without the pressure or burnout of doing it all on your own.\n\nHere\u2019s how it works:\nYou create a profile once. When someone aligns with what you\u2019re looking for, we send you the introduction. You review, you decide. No endless swiping. No awkward cold starts. Just intentional connections with people who are also serious about meeting someone.\n\nWe work across Maryland, DC, and Northern Virginia, and our network is constantly evolving with singles who are relationship-minded and ready to meet in real life.\n\nIf you\u2019re feeling tired of the current dating cycle and want a more thoughtful way to meet someone, this is a simple step in a better direction.\n\nJoin the candidate network https://www.mdssclub.com/candidate-network",
