    "description": "Artificial Intelligence is moving beyond simple conversation and into the era of action. This session explores the transformative shift from Chat AI, which focuses on dialogue, to Agentic AI, where systems are designed to reason, use tools, and execute complex tasks autonomously.\nTitle: Agentic AI and Chat AI\nDate & Time: 29th May 2026 \\| 08:00 PM \\- 09:00 PM IST \\| 9:30 AM\\- 10:30 AM CDT\nLocation: Online \\| [Register Now](https://zoom.us/j/99898122253?pwd=HEAf6a01fZI6EX6YPmVkaR1fg08D8d.1)\n\n**What You\u2019ll Learn**\n\n* From Chat to Agency: Understanding the shift from passive LLMs to active AI agents.\n* Core Architectures: How planning, memory, and tool-use enable autonomous behavior.\n* Workflow Automation: Real-world examples of AI agents solving multi-step problems.\n* Human-in-the-loop: Balancing autonomy with oversight and safety protocols.\n* The Future Roadmap: What comes after chatbots in the enterprise landscape.\n\n### **Who Should Attend**\n\n* AI Developers, Software Architects, and Product Innovators.\n* Business Leaders looking to automate complex operational workflows.\n* Tech Enthusiasts who are curious about the next frontier of LLM applications.\n\n### **Speaker**\n\nLeonard Rodman\\, M\\.Sc\\. \\| AI Consultant & API Automation Engineer\nLeonard Rodman is a Chicago-based AI Consultant with 20+ years of experience turning AI potential into real business outcomes. He specializes in building agentic AI workflows \u2014 connecting Claude API, MCP, OpenAI, and enterprise platforms to automate complex, multi-step processes.\nCurrently at Trainicity as a Docebo Implementation Consultant and API Engineer, Leonard has led large-scale LMS deployments and custom AI integrations for organizations of all sizes. He also mentors AI startups at 1871's AI Innovation Lab, contributes to the OpenAI Forum, and is a Training Magazine APEX Top 15 Hall of Fame recipient.\n\nZoom Link:[https://zoom.us/j/99898122253?pwd=HEAf6a01fZI6EX6YPmVkaR1fg08D8d.1](https://www.google.com/url?q=https://zoom.us/j/99898122253?pwd%3DHEAf6a01fZI6EX6YPmVkaR1fg08D8d.1&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1780460505640799&usg=AOvVaw2D_u07F8rTVjnQ3m-KZG_U)\n\n### **Don\u2019t Miss Out**\n\nDiscover how to transition from basic chatbots to sophisticated AI agents that drive real-world results.\n#AgenticAI #LLMs #ArtificialIntelligence #Automation #FutureOfTech #AIWorkflows",
