    "description": "An elevated evening above the city.\n\n[AVIARY SKYBAR : HOW TO GET IN](https://www.instagram.com/p/DYO8UV0MGjF/?next=%2F)\n\nJoin a carefully curated rooftop gathering hosted inside one of London\u2019s luxury 5-star hotels, where skyline views, ambient music, and unexpected conversations set the tone for the night.\n\nShould the weather shift, the evening will continue seamlessly inside the skybar lounge\n\nWhat to expect:\n\u2022 Panoramic views stretching across London after dark\n\u2022 An international crowd of creatives, professionals, travelers, and curious minds\n\u2022 A relaxed yet refined atmosphere designed for genuine connections\n\u2022 Cocktails, conversations, and a rooftop experience hidden above the city.\n\n.\n\n**Dress Code: Smart**\n**18+ Only**\n\n**Ticket Price:**\n\nTICKET PRICE **\u00a35** :[ ](https://buy.stripe.com/4gMeVf6DzesY9ET8TjfUQ06)**[BOOK YOUR TICKET](https://buy.stripe.com/5kQ4gB5zvdoUeZdglLfUQ07)**[ ](https://buy.stripe.com/5kQ4gB5zvdoUeZdglLfUQ07)",
