    "description": "Hello, This event is for anyone who enjoys reading and wants to do it in the quiet company of others. We\u2019ll be reading together in complete silence no pressure to talk, just bring whatever you\u2019re reading and settle in.\n\nWhen you arrive, grab a drink from the caf\u00e9 if you like, find a comfy spot, and start reading. We\u2019re usually there for about 2 hours, but feel free to come and go whenever it works for you. Looking forward to meeting you!\n\nDee",
