    "id": "scraped-492-meetup",
    "slug": "stralsund-from-berlin-city-hike-by-baltic-sea-meetup-492",
    "orgId": "org-meetup",
    "organizerId": "org-meetup",
    "organizerName": "Meetup Verified Host",
    "organizerColor": "#FF4D4D",
    "title": "Stralsund from Berlin \ud83c\udf0a\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f : City + Hike by Baltic Sea",
    "subtitle": "Curated from Meetup \u00b7 Berlin",
    "category": "conference",
    "type": "other",
    "tags": [
      "Berlin",
      "Meetup",
      "Conference"
    ],
    "description": "2 EURO DONATION FEE PER PERSON IS REQUIRED (on site, in cash), to pay back the Meetup subscription fees and support my Events.\nREAD THE DESCRIPTION WITH THE INFO (IMPORTANT).\nWHATSAPP LINK BELOW \ud83d\udcf3\u200b\n\nWe will visit Stralsund, a wonderful city by the Baltic sea \ud83d\udc92\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f \ud83c\udf0a(its old city center is also UNESCO world heritage).\n\nWe take the RE3 train that stops at Berlin Hbf at 09,18 AM\ud83d\ude89\ud83d\ude00 and arrives to Stralsund at 12,44 AM\nThe train does not stop only in Hbf: I attach below the screenshots with the stations and the timetable \ud83d\udd50\nGet on in the station you prefer, but take that train \ud83d\ude89\nThe train is a direct train and takeable with DE Ticket \ud83d\ude01\n\nBring your own food\ud83c\udf54 and drinks\ud83e\udd64.\nBreaks \u26d4: We will take 2 breaks during the day, one in the City Center and one during the Hike at the Devin Halbinsel\n\nPlan and info \u2139\ufe0f:\n\n* We arrive at 12,44 at Stralsund\n* We walk through the city touching places such as Wei\u00dfe Br\u00fccken, Marienkirche, Alter Markt square, Kniepertor, Nordmole and the harbor area\n* We take the bus at Stralsund, Wasserstra\u00dfe at 15,40, direction Devin\n* We Make this Hike of 7.2kms along the Baltic Sea: https://www.komoot.com/tour/2850057845\n* We take the bus at 18,05 to come back to Stralsund Hbf\n* At Stralsund Hbf area we have time to eat/rink something, and then take the train to come back at 19,10\n\nI do not provide a \"personal support\" for people who do not take the indicated train.\nYou are responsible to check for the weather and decide if come or not.\nThanks for understanding.\n\nIf you have to contact me, make it via Whatsapp, not here on Meetup.\nWHATSAPP COMMUNITY \ud83d\udcac to find each other (join it, we use this group to find and synchronize us, as well as post photos)\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/157uLVXObKt1a4NqqvPa09NJW-050YBwHLW-7DbOD8R8/](https://docs.google.com/document/d/157uLVXObKt1a4NqqvPa09NJW-050YBwHLW-7DbOD8R8/)",
