    "id": "scraped-495-meetup",
    "slug": "longevity-homes-lifestyles-golf-shopping-festival-san-francisco-edition-meetup-4",
    "orgId": "org-meetup",
    "organizerId": "org-meetup",
    "organizerName": "Meetup Verified Host",
    "organizerColor": "#FF4D4D",
    "title": "Longevity, Homes & Lifestyles, Golf & Shopping Festival \u2013 San Francisco Edition",
    "subtitle": "Curated from Meetup \u00b7 San Francisco",
    "category": "hackathon",
    "type": "hackathon",
    "tags": [
      "San Francisco",
      "Meetup",
      "Hackathon"
    ],
    "description": "## **Longevity, Homes & Lifestyles, Golf & Shopping Festival \u2013 San Francisco Edition**\n\n**June 20 \u2013 23\\, 2026 \\| San Francisco**\n\n***\n\n### **Overview**\n\nThe **San Francisco** Edition of the Longevity, Homes & Lifestyles, Golf & Shopping Festival is a four-day international event bringing together longevity, wellness, innovation, premium lifestyle, and elite golf experiences in one dynamic setting.\nHosted in San Francisco and connected to the wider Bay Area innovation and lifestyle ecosystem, the event integrates biohacking, smart living, luxury travel, real estate, and future-oriented solutions within one of the world\u2019s leading hubs for technology and forward-thinking ideas.\nIt brings together entrepreneurs, private clients, global brands, investors, and high-level decision-makers from around the world. A strong focus is placed on holistic lifestyle design and immersive experiences, engaging all five senses \u2014 light, sound, scent, touch, and taste \u2014 combined with access to advanced longevity and biohacking solutions.\n\n***\n\n### **Featured Experiences**\n\n**Golf Pro-Am Charity Tournament**\nPlay or sponsor \u2013 advance booking required. Limited field, filling fast. A premium golf and networking experience in a relaxed, high-level setting.\n**Biohacking Spa Experience (Saturday\u2013Tuesday)**\nPersonalized treatments such as red light therapy, recovery, and vitality sessions at selected hotel spas or within the expo environment. Pre-booking and advance payment required. Limited VIP availability.\n\n***\n\n### **Why Attend**\n\n* Discover the latest trends in longevity, lifestyle, and innovation\n* Connect with entrepreneurs, investors, and international participants\n* Experience immersive environments across all five senses\n* Explore opportunities for business growth, partnerships, and expansion\n\n***\n\n### **Event Format**\n\n#### **Weekend Expo \\(Saturday\u2013Sunday \\| Public Access\\)**\n\n**Lifestyle, inspiration, and immersive experiences**\n\n* Longevity, Wellness & Biohacking\n* Biohacking tools, devices & live demonstrations\n* Fitness, performance & recovery\n* Premium lifestyle & holistic design\n* Smart homes & future living concepts\n* Spa, pool & regeneration experiences\n* Luxury travel, resorts, golf & cruising\n* Premium real estate & lifestyle concepts\n* Future mobility & innovation\n* Lifestyle & entertainment zone\n* Saturday night benefit concert\n* Networking & social atmosphere\n\n***\n\n### **Biohacking \u2013 Key Themes**\n\n* Longevity & health optimization\n* Sleep & recovery\n* Brain performance & mental clarity\n* Biohacking tools & devices\n* Cold, heat & light therapies\n* Testing & personalized diagnostics\n* Nutrition & supplements\n* Breathwork & nervous system regulation\n\n***\n\n### **B2B & Business Days \\(Monday\u2013Tuesday \\| Limited Access\\)**\n\n**Business, partnerships, and high-level opportunities**\n\n* Premium real estate & investment opportunities\n* Smart living developments\n* Longevity clinics & performance technologies\n* Health innovation, AI & digital solutions\n* Luxury travel & wellness concepts\n* Future mobility & infrastructure\n* Startups, innovation & international expansion\n* Investment opportunities & deal flow\n* Strategic partnerships & curated matchmaking\n\n***\n\n### **Who Attends**\n\nEntrepreneurs \u2022 Investors \u2022 Real Estate Professionals \u2022 Wellness & Lifestyle Brands \u2022 Travel & Hospitality Experts \u2022 Innovation Companies \u2022 Ambitious Individuals\n\n***\n\n### **Concept**\n\n* Weekend: Open, high-energy lifestyle experience\n* Monday\u2013Tuesday: Focused business, investment, and networking\n\n***\n\n### **Event Details**\n\n* Dates: June 20 \u2013 23, 2026\n* Time: 09:00 AM \u2013 06:00 PM\n* Location: San Francisco\n* Format: 4-Day International Event (Public + B2B)\n\n***\n\n### **At a Glance**\n\n* 4-day international event\n* Weekend: public lifestyle expo\n* Monday\u2013Tuesday: business & networking\n* International participants and leading brands expected\n\n***\n\n### **Final Note**\n\nCapacity is limited \u2014 early booking is recommended. Secure your participation and be part of a unique four-day experience combining lifestyle, innovation, and opportunity.\n\n***\n\n### **Ticket & Exhibitor Booth Booking Policy**\n\nThe purchase of a visitor ticket or an exhibitor booth booking constitutes a binding registration. Cancellations are not permitted. The event is subject to postponement only, not cancellation.\nIn the event of a postponement, all tickets and exhibitor booth bookings remain fully valid and automatically transfer to the new date. If postponed multiple times, they remain valid for the latest scheduled date.\nExhibitors may also postpone their participation, with bookings remaining valid for a rescheduled date.",
