    "description": "**RSVP via:**\nhttps://app.gistirl.com/event-details/0XJAM5dbalORhWtc0i9p\n**Early Bird Discounts | More $ Later**\n\n^^USE THE LINK TO GET A TICKET.\n(Also, we had a huge turnout last time, so we will cap the event at MAX 80 people!!\n\nPicture this: you're ending the week the way it should be: outside, drink in hand, surrounded by new people who actually feel easy to talk to! This is a space where you show up solo and quickly find yourself laughing, connecting, and settling into a table that already feels like your crew.\n\nYou will spend the first hour in real one-on-one conversations, seamlessly paired up by the app so you always know exactly who you are talking to next. It's like speed-friending! Every 6-8 minutes, you'll rotate to a randomized new person!\n\nAgenda\n\n4:50PM - Check-In\nOpen the GIST app to check in!\n\n5:00PM - 6:00PM - One-on-One Rounds\nOur app pairs you for focused conversations. Find out who shares your taste in local brews and favorite sunny outdoor hangouts. 1-1 conversations/ speed-friending rounds!\n\n6:00PM+ - Form Groups & find a spot at the beer garden and order a round together\nReconnect with your favorite matches, form groups of 4-6, and find a spot at the beer garden and order a round together.\n\nWant to stay in touch with someone? Use the app - it lets you connect without ever sharing your phone number.\n\n**RSVP via:**\nhttps://app.gistirl.com/event-details/0XJAM5dbalORhWtc0i9p\n**Early Bird Discounts | More $ Later**",
