    "description": "If anxiety, overthinking, or stress have been weighing on you, this guided EFT tapping session is here to help you reduce anxiety and reconnect with a **calmer**, more grounded state within yourself.\n\nThrough guided EFT tapping, we\u2019ll work with the ***subconscious*** patterns that may be keeping your mind and body stuck in stress mode.\n\nEFT tapping is a mind-body technique that combines focused attention with tapping on specific acupressure points to help release emotional tension and create a greater sense of emotional relief.\n\nWe\u2019ll begin with a brief introduction to EFT tapping and then move into a guided group session focused on calming the nervous system and releasing anxiety.\n\n\u2728 No prior experience needed.\n\n\u231a Please make sure to arrive on time to receive the full benefits of the session. Thank you!",
