    "description": "On June 4, the Moon will be in a Waning Gibbous phase. This phase symbolizes a spiritual period for reflection, gratitude, letting go of negativity, and releasing habits that no longer serve you. It encourages cleansing emotional and physical clutter.\n\nLet's get together as a group and participate in a grounding and cleansing meditation followed by a discussion about how this Moon phase relates to our current life situation. Finally, as time permits, let's use the Moon tarot cards to receive an intuitive message from the Universe. This online meeting is free, and the duration is 1 hr. Come join us for an evening of grounding, cleansing, and intuitive fellowship!",
