    "description": "**I'm excited to hope to see every single one of you at this** **new event****. The last one did not work out due to the fact that no one signed up so please sign up. There is no fee no charge and I'm asking no dues to be in the** **script** **I am taking all of the financial responsibility for everything****. You're in charge of your own drinks in your own food. The dessert is the collaboration, the networking the socializing and making new friends. I look forward to seeing everyone there. This is a great little spot with** **a** **pool table in the upper loft and many things to do right around in the general area****. Maybe afterwards we can arrange to do something else****.** **if anyone has any other suggestions** **for Events,** **please feel free to reach out to me. I appreciate every one of you for signing up and being who you are.**",
