    "description": "**Looking for a business networking event in London for property, construction, and trade professionals?** Join us in Fitzrovia for a quality networking evening bringing together business owners, contractors, landlords, and professionals connected to the built environment.\nHosted by GMax Card \u2014 a digital business card platform helping business owners share all their contact details through one simple link.\n\n## What to Expect\n\nA relaxed but professional networking evening designed for meaningful business conversations and quality connections.\nMeet people across property, construction, maintenance, and business services in an atmosphere that feels social, productive, and well-organised - not an overcrowded conference or random pub meetup.\nWhether you're looking for new clients, trusted suppliers, partnerships, referrals, or industry contacts, our hosts are there from the start to help make introductions.\n\n## Who You'll Meet\n\n* Property professionals and landlords\n* Builders, contractors, and construction professionals\n* Electricians, plumbers, HVAC, and maintenance specialists\n* Interior design, fit-out, and renovation professionals\n* Estate agents, letting agents, and block management professionals\n* Business owners and service providers working with property and trade sectors\n* Finance, mortgage, insurance, and property investment professionals\n\n## Schedule\n\n18:30 \u2014 Arrival & welcome\n19:00 \u2014 Short introductions\n19:30 \u2014 Open networking\n21:30 \u2014 Close\nHosts are there from the beginning to help facilitate introductions and conversations.\n\n## Venue: The Refinery at Regent\u2019s Place\n\nA modern and spacious venue in the heart of Fitzrovia with a relaxed professional atmosphere - ideal for quality networking and business conversations.\nLocated moments from Warren Street station, close to Euston.\n\n## Entry & GMax Cards\n\nFree RSVP: Event access only\nPaid ticket (when available): Includes a contactless GMax Card (please ask the host to claim your card)\n\n## Dress Code\n\nBusiness / Smart casual\n\n## Hosted by\n\n[GMax Card - a digital business card](www.gmaxcard.com) platform helping professionals and businesses share all their contact details through one simple link.\n\n## Important Info\n\n* 18+ (ID may be required)\n* Photos/video may be captured by CineEye Audiovisual Production Studio\n* Attendance is at your own risk\n\n**Limited spots available - early registration recommended!**",
