    "description": "Meet new people, make new mates & have a ridiculously fun night out in London?\n\nWelcome to the most outrageous, chaotic and socially competitive pub quiz in the city.\n\nWhether you come solo or with friends, you\u2019ll be thrown straight into the madness with a bunch of lovely strangers who may or may not become your new besties.\n\nExpect ridiculous quiz rounds, comedy, challenges, prizes, bad teamwork, questionable knowledge & absolute scenes. Plus \ud83c\udfc6 Win:\n\u2022 \u00a3100 Bar Tab\n\u2022 Plastic Medals (worthless financially, priceless emotionally)\n\u2022 Ultimate pub quiz glory\nWe\u2019ll be wrapped up by around 8:30/8:45pm\u2026 unless you and your new mates decide to keep the night going afterwards.\n\nNo quiz knowledge required. Just good vibes and a tolerance for chaos.\n\n**\u23f1\ufe0fSchedule:**\n**6:00 PM \u2013 Arrival & Mingling \ud83c\udf7b**\nGet a drink, meet your teammates and settle in.\n**6:30 PM \u2013 Quiz Kick-Off \ud83e\udde0**\nThe Quiz Chaos begins \u2014 ease yourself in\u2026 it won\u2019t stay calm for long.\n**8.30 PM \u2013 Results & Prizes \ud83c\udfc6**\nWinners crowned, losers\u2026 dealt with accordingly.\n**Onwards \u2013 Post-Quiz Social \u2728**\nStick around for drinks, games, and general chaos.\n\n***\n\n**\ud83c\udfaf Good to know:**\n\n* No quiz experience needed (honestly, it might make things worse)\n* Either come with a team or solo-- and we find your team mates group!\n* Expect laughs, not perfection\n\nCome for the quiz, stay for the chaos",
